hub.com"},"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T16:11:14.000+08:00","name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"},"message":"feat(agent): LangGraph 编排 P0+P1 与 Agent Run API (#98)\n\n* feat(agent): LangGraph 编排 P0+P1 与 Agent Run API\n\n引入 @aimarket/agent-core（多厂商编排 LLM、LangGraph 会话图）与 agent_runs\n持久化；/agent/plan 支持 LLM+fallback，新增 /agent/runs 生命周期与 Job 完成\n自动 resume。补充技术规格文档与集成测试。\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(docker): 构建时包含并编译 @aimarket/agent-core\n\nDockerfile.api 复制 agent-core 包并在 API 编译前先 build；\nCI lint 阶段同步增加 agent-core build，修复 docker-build 找不到模块。\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(agent-core): typecheck 使用 src 类型入口，避免 CI 需先 build\n\nexports.types 指向 src；补充 API 侧 PlanStep/AgentSessionState 注解。\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(ci): 启动 API 前先 build agent-core\n\ntsx 运行期依赖 dist/index.js；start-api 与 Integration 流程补齐\nagent-core 编译及 orchestration 集成测试步骤。\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/git/trees/f415bf950398a1e56b4e8c00e906fa9e61d1b965","sha":"f415bf950398a1e56b4e8c00e906fa9e61d1b965"},"comment_count":0},"author":{"login":"sev7n4","id":130808187,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8v5ew","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130808187?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4","html_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/